      "statement": "wux-rs ships no keys and tries each candidate key: the disc key is the one that decrypts the partition table, and the common key the one whose title key opens the game partition's FST, so disc keys and the common key can share Cemu's keys.txt; parse_keys reads one 32-digit hex key per line, ignoring text after # or ; and dropping spaces, tabs, dashes and underscores.",
