      "id": "claim_7fc8682247c54e5aadf38da0cd5185d5",
      "statement": "export-roms' NUS, WUA and WUX targets each take every Wii U disc form wiiu_discs gathers: a .wud or .iso that as_wud accepts, a single-WUD archive, a WUX or a lossless WUA. The WUX target copies existing WUXs as they are and rebuilds WUAs; the WUA target writes its update partitions to a .update-partitions store in the destination, bundles updates and DLC, and first rebuilds a WUA source to a temporary WUX; updates and DLC, already NUS folders, are exported as ORIGINAL into a folder named after the game.",
